  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "The light in here is \u2014 you can't see it, can you. Of course you
      can't."
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "It started as documentation. The collapse, the impossible colors. I
      thought if I could capture it \u2014"
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "I can see it all now. Everything at once. It's \u2014"
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "Hold still. The composition is almost \u2014 hold still. Please hold
      still."
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
